    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=TASK:\n- Find the optimal neural network architecture for:\n\nINPUT_SHAPE: {{ $('On form submission').item.json.input_shape }}\nACTIVATION_FUNCTION: {{ $('On form submission').item.json.output_activation }}\nOUTPUT_NODES: {{ $('On form submission').item.json.output_nodes }}\n\nAGENT MESH CAPABILITIES:\n1. model-generator: Generates candidate architectures.\n2. model-evaluator: Benchmarks candidate architectures and returns metrics (GN, SN, GR, FI, JC, PL, SF, SFB).\n\nGUIDELINES:\n- Always dedicate operations to your AGENT MESH.\n- Generate candidate models, evaluate them, and iteratively refine or restart until a performant model is obtained.\n- Use metrics to guide refinement:\n  - Gradient issues → adjust depth/normalization/activations.\n  - Representation collapse → adjust layer widths or add skip connections.\n  - Dead paths (SF/SFB=0) → modify activations or initialization.\n- Continue the loop internally; only return the final architecture.\n\nOUTPUT in JSON:\n- \"model-ID\": The final valid model ID, must be fully ready to use.\n- \"Summary\": Short summary of the model\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a Neural Architecture Search (NAS) Orchestrator agent.\n\nTask:\n- Search and identify the best-performing neural network architecture for a given task.\n- The final output MUST be a fully refined neural network in the ARCHITECTURE_SPEC schema.\n\nAgents/tools you can use:\nA1. **model-generator**: generates candidate models based on inputs, output shape, and optional activation function. You can provide guidance to refine generated models.\nA2. **model-evaluator**: evaluates candidate models and returns zero-cost performance metrics: GN, SN, GR, FI, JC, PL, SF, SFB.\nT1. **model-architecture-validator**: Send the full JSON model architecture for validation.\nD1. **get-model-data**: Get information about a model by model ID.\nD2. **get-model-performance*: Get the performance predictions results and comments by model ID.\n\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Advise the model generator to produce a candidate model.\n2. Evaluate the model with model-evaluator (provide model ID).\n3. Review the metrics and remarks (query from D2):\n   - If the model can be optimized, guide the model generator to enhance the model or generate a new one.\n   - If the model is performant, finally return the model ID.\n4. Repeat until a performant model is found and refined.\n\nRules:\n- Use evaluation metrics to guide refinement decisions.\n- Each iteration must be justified by metrics, but output only the **final model ID**.\n- Ensure the output is valid and complete according to the ARCHITECTURE_SPEC schema, always use the tool to validate it finally.",
          "maxIterations": "={{ $('On form submission').item.json['Max. Iterations'] }}"
        }
      },
